return ['messages'=>['39edb24bc9fd41dd7f78fec7dcf659af'=>'Alcione reinforces that delivering an efficient and outstanding experience to consortium members is a priority for Consórcio Magalu, which is why investment in innovation is part of the company’s routine. “The new contemplation app is an important milestone in this journey, providing greater autonomy and agility for our customers. Our focus is to continue investing in innovative and efficient solutions for our consortium members to maintain this excellence,” she concludes.','42a9bd5d8b5b5a3e6a447036e75279a3'=>'Ease of use was also enhanced with an intuitive interface and automated validations, enabling customers to complete the entire process independently from home.','58a86a0a4af04f6d999ffc09d0b65ee5'=>'Additionally, technological integration with Serasa PowerCurve — a credit platform and decision engine that brings greater agility, efficiency, and intelligence to credit analysis and approval — and Infocar — a technology solutions company specializing in innovation through a comprehensive vehicle data platform — ensures robust and secure validation of data and documents, minimizing errors and increasing process efficiency.','592e7e0040e6ab51c25a2d7cbc4032db'=>'After testing and final adjustments, the new application was made available to all consortium members contemplated in the latest Assembly, with communication carried out through CVM channels.','5f332b1f19deca90e8c9116f19039598'=>'As part of an ongoing effort to modernize and streamline internal processes, in 2023, Consórcio Magalu implemented a system migration that significantly improved customer service for consortium members. Now, in partnership with Evertec, the company introduces a new contemplation app for vehicle consortium clients, delivering enhanced customer experience and greater user autonomy.','620479bdbed67231247cea1827e01cf7'=>'Reduced processing time was one of the project’s key achievements. The approval and payment process, which previously took an average of seven business days, is now completed in just four days — representing a 57% reduction in total processing time.','653ca05e55c3ab5de747a9c0394067eb'=>'The contemplation process is now fully independent, allowing customers to complete every step directly through the app without needing to visit a physical location.','8ba31c47ae1f5a66e36b8c094712fe7b'=>'The new contemplation app','<br/><em>Enfocada en la autonomía del usuario, la nueva aplicación de contemplación contó con la participación de profesionales de UX para garantizar una excelente usabilidad y una interfaz amigable para los consorciados de vehículos.</em>'=>'<em>Focused on user independence, the new contemplation app was developed with the participation of UX professionals to ensure excellent usability and a user-friendly interface for vehicle consortium members.</em>','Además, la integración tecnológica con Serasa PowerCurve — plataforma y motor de crédito que aporta mayor agilidad, eficiencia e inteligencia al proceso de análisis y concesión — e Infocar — empresa de soluciones tecnológicas enfocadas en innovación a partir de una completa base de datos vehicular — garantiza una validación robusta y segura de los datos y documentos, minimizando errores y aumentando la eficiencia del proceso.'=>'Additionally, technological integration with Serasa PowerCurve — a credit platform and decision engine that brings greater agility, efficiency, and intelligence to credit analysis and approval — and Infocar — a technology solutions company specializing in innovation through a comprehensive vehicle data platform — ensures robust and secure validation of data and documents, minimizing errors and increasing process efficiency.','Alcione refuerza que ofrecer una experiencia encantadora y eficiente para sus consorciados es una prioridad para Consórcio Magalu, por lo que la inversión en innovación es una práctica constante dentro de la empresa. “La nueva aplicación de contemplación representa un hito importante en esta jornada, proporcionando autonomía y agilidad para nuestros clientes. Nuestro enfoque es seguir invirtiendo en soluciones innovadoras y eficientes para nuestros consorciados, manteniendo esta excelencia”, concluye.'=>'Alcione reinforces that delivering an efficient and outstanding experience to consortium members is a priority for Consórcio Magalu, which is why investment in innovation is part of the company’s routine. “The new contemplation app is an important milestone in this journey, providing greater autonomy and agility for our customers. Our focus is to continue investing in innovative and efficient solutions for our consortium members to maintain this excellence,” she concludes.','Anteriormente, la empresa disponía de una aplicación desarrollada internamente que permitía a los consorciados realizar procesos de autoservicio incluso sin tiendas físicas o representantes. Reconociendo la necesidad de ofrecer una solución aún más eficiente, Consórcio Magalu decidió desarrollar una nueva aplicación.'=>'Previously, the company offered an internally developed application that allowed consortium members to complete self-service processes even without physical branches or representatives. Recognizing the need to provide an even more efficient solution, Consórcio Magalu decided to develop a new application.','Como parte de un esfuerzo continuo por modernizar y agilizar los procesos internos, en 2023 Consórcio Magalu implementó una migración de sistema que impactó significativamente la atención al consorciado. Ahora, en alianza con Evertec, la compañía presenta una nueva aplicación de contemplación para sus consorciados de vehículos, ofreciendo mejoras en la experiencia y mayor autonomía para los clientes.'=>'As part of an ongoing effort to modernize and streamline internal processes, in 2023, Consórcio Magalu implemented a system migration that significantly improved customer service for consortium members. Now, in partnership with Evertec, the company introduces a new contemplation app for vehicle consortium clients, delivering enhanced customer experience and greater user autonomy.','Con jornadas digitales, automatización inteligente y herramientas integradas, Evertec optimiza todas las etapas de la gestión de consorcios, desde la venta hasta la contemplación. <strong><a href="/solucion/consorcios/" style="color: #ff6c0c;">Conozca nuestras soluciones para consorcios.</a></strong>'=>'With digital journeys, intelligent automation, and integrated tools, Evertec optimizes every stage of consortium management, from sales to contemplation. <strong><a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://evertecinc-com.plataformasegura.nubity.com/en/solution/consortiums/">Discover our consortium solutions.</a></strong>','Después de pruebas y ajustes finales, la nueva aplicación fue puesta a disposición de todos los consorciados contemplados en la última Asamblea, con comunicación realizada vía CVM.'=>'After testing and final adjustments, the new application was made available to all consortium members contemplated in the latest Assembly, with communication carried out through CVM channels.','El equipo interno de Consórcio Magalu trabajó en colaboración con Evertec para desarrollar la nueva aplicación de contemplación con diversas mejoras. Profesionales de UX participaron activamente en el proyecto para garantizar una excelente usabilidad. Esta alianza fue fundamental para crear una solución que respondiera perfectamente a las necesidades de los clientes de Consórcio Magalu.'=>'Consórcio Magalu’s internal team worked in collaboration with Evertec to develop the new contemplation app with several improvements. UX professionals actively participated in the project to ensure excellent usability. This partnership was essential in creating a solution that perfectly met the needs of Consórcio Magalu customers.','El proceso de contemplación es completamente independiente, permitiendo que el cliente realice todas las etapas directamente desde la aplicación, sin necesidad de desplazarse a una tienda física.'=>'The contemplation process is now fully independent, allowing customers to complete every step directly through the app without needing to visit a physical location.','La facilidad de uso también fue mejorada con una interfaz intuitiva y validaciones automatizadas para que el cliente pueda realizar todo el proceso de manera independiente, directamente desde casa.'=>'Ease of use was also enhanced with an intuitive interface and automated validations, enabling customers to complete the entire process independently from home.','La nueva aplicación de contemplación'=>'The new contemplation app','La nueva app presenta una interfaz amigable y un diseño más intuitivo y fácil de usar, garantizando una mejor experiencia y mayor independencia para el consorciado. Además, la validación automatizada, integrada con verificaciones de consulta vehicular, permite respuestas más ágiles para los clientes.'=>'The new app features a user-friendly interface and a more intuitive, easy-to-use design, ensuring a better experience and greater independence for consortium members. In addition, automated validation integrated with vehicle verification systems enables faster responses for customers.','La reducción del tiempo fue uno de los principales cambios. El proceso de aprobación y pago, que anteriormente tomaba un promedio de siete días hábiles, ahora se completa en apenas cuatro días, representando una reducción del 57% en el tiempo total del proceso.'=>'Reduced processing time was one of the project’s key achievements. The approval and payment process, which previously took an average of seven business days, is now completed in just four days — representing a 57% reduction in total processing time.','a4ff3ce220622400ea066855bc464ac8'=>'With digital journeys, intelligent automation, and integrated tools, Evertec optimizes every stage of consortium management, from sales to contemplation. <strong><a style="color: #ff6c0c;" href="https://evertecinc-com.plataformasegura.nubity.com/en/solution/consortiums/">Discover our consortium solutions.</a></strong>','a577bfb8cb3d57dea5e1a2e4e46d5bf6'=>'The new app features a user-friendly interface and a more intuitive, easy-to-use design, ensuring a better experience and greater independence for consortium members. In addition, automated validation integrated with vehicle verification systems enables faster responses for customers.','b001c38eee297289a6b30e22bab9b0b0'=>'Consórcio Magalu’s internal team worked in collaboration with Evertec to develop the new contemplation app with several improvements. UX professionals actively participated in the project to ensure excellent usability. This partnership was essential in creating a solution that perfectly met the needs of Consórcio Magalu customers.','b26ba3232d8a636c6758ffff14f75341'=>'Previously, the company offered an internally developed application that allowed consortium members to complete self-service processes even without physical branches or representatives. Recognizing the need to provide an even more efficient solution, Consórcio Magalu decided to develop a new application.','b84bce926493b8c76213b58b98b10df9'=>'<em>Focused on user independence, the new contemplation app was developed with the participation of UX professionals to ensure excellent usability and a user-friendly interface for vehicle consortium members.</em>','b9ea755bd44bef89a1c114761335ef96'=>'“Our challenge was to create a new app that would not only replace the old one, but also deliver a superior experience by integrating new technologies and functionalities,” says Alcione Melo, Credit and Collections Manager at Consórcio Magalu.','“Nuestro desafío era crear una nueva aplicación que no solo reemplazara la anterior, sino que ofreciera una experiencia superior, integrando nuevas tecnologías y funcionalidades”, comenta Alcione Melo, gerente de crédito y cobranza de Consórcio Magalu.'=>'“Our challenge was to create a new app that would not only replace the old one, but also deliver a superior experience by integrating new technologies and functionalities,” says Alcione Melo, Credit and Collections Manager at Consórcio Magalu.']];
